        "licence": "Public-Domain",
        "start": 31.82,
        "end": 34.98
      },
      "textSource": "Лев Толстой, «Лев, волк и лисица» (1875), https://ru.wikisource.org/wiki/%D0%9B%D0%B5%D0%B2,_%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BA_%D0%B8_%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0_%28%D0%AD%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF;_%D0%9B%D0%B5%D0%B2_%D0%A2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B9%29",
      "review": {
        "text": "unreviewed",
        "ipa": "unreviewed",
        "by": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ru-02",
      "lang": "ru",
      "file": "ru-02.flac",
      "text": "Приходили все звери проведывать царя, только лисица не бывала.",
      "ipa": "prʲɪxɐˈdʲilʲɪ fsʲe ˈzvʲerʲɪ prɐˈvʲedɨvətʲ t͡sɐˈrʲa ˈtolʲkə lʲɪˈsʲit͡sə nʲɪ bɨˈvaɫə",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "librivox-1593",
        "sex": "unknown"
      },
      "duration": 5.14,
      "sha256": "544ec4083bcd0a18ea96756f0c0f60c921a2d5b433bb1766b776de5b938b1a73",
      "source": {
        "dataset": "librivox-aesop-ru-13",
        "page": "https://librivox.org/aesops-fables-in-russian/",
        "licence": "Public-Domain",
        "start": 34.98,
        "end": 40.12
      },
      "textSource": "Лев Толстой, «Лев, волк и лисица» (1875), https://ru.wikisource.org/wiki/%D0%9B%D0%B5%D0%B2,_%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BA_%D0%B8_%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0_%28%D0%AD%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF;_%D0%9B%D0%B5%D0%B2_%D0%A2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B9%29",
      "review": {
        "text": "unreviewed",
        "ipa": "unreviewed",
        "by": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ru-03",
      "lang": "ru",
      "file": "ru-03.flac",
      "text": "Только теперь нашла, вот и прибежала.",
      "ipa": "ˈtolʲkə tʲɪˈpʲerʲ nɐʂˈɫa vot i prʲɪbʲɪˈʐaɫə",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "librivox-1593",
