        "licence": "Public-Domain",
        "start": 80.39,
        "end": 83.53
      },
      "textSource": "Лев Толстой, «Лев, волк и лисица» (1875), https://ru.wikisource.org/wiki/%D0%9B%D0%B5%D0%B2,_%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BA_%D0%B8_%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0_%28%D0%AD%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF;_%D0%9B%D0%B5%D0%B2_%D0%A2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B9%29",
