        "licence": "Public-Domain",
        "start": 55.435,
        "end": 60.49
      },
      "textSource": "Лев Толстой, «Комар и лев» (1875), https://ru.wikisource.org/wiki/%D0%9A%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%80_%D0%B8_%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B2_%28%D0%AD%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF;_%D0%9B%D0%B5%D0%B2_%D0%A2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B9%29",
      "review": {
