      },
      "textSource": "Лев Толстой, «Пчёлы и трутни» (1875), https://ru.wikisource.org/wiki/%D0%9F%D1%87%D1%91%D0%BB%D1%8B_%D0%B8_%D1%82%D1%80%D1%83%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%B8_%28%D0%AD%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF;_%D0%9B%D0%B5%D0%B2_%D0%A2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B9%29",
