        "end": 133.13
      },
      "textSource": "प्रेमचंद, दो सखियाँ (1926), https://gadyakosh.org/gk/%E0%A4%A6%E0%A5%8B_%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%96%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%81_/_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%9A%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%A6_/_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%83%E0%A4%B7%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A0_6",
      "review": {
