        "by": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-01",
      "lang": "zh",
      "file": "zh-01.flac",
      "text": "读书法，有三到，心眼口，信皆要。",
      "ipa": "tu˧˥ ʂu˥ fa˨˩˦ joʊ˨˩ san˥ tɑʊ˥˩ ɕin˥ jɛn˧˥ kʰoʊ˨˩˦ ɕin˥˩ t͡ɕjɛ˥ jɑʊ˥˩",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "librivox-2245",
        "sex": "unknown"
      },
      "duration": 5.43,
      "sha256": "06396a164ffabc2377d8b643f4755043f05b32a32e2106132b1a27685c7e145b",
      "source": {
        "dataset": "librivox-di-zi-gui-zh-03",
        "page": "https://librivox.org/di-zi-gui-by-li-yuexiu/",
        "licence": "Public-Domain",
        "start": 536.6,
        "end": 542.03
      },
      "textSource": "李毓秀《弟子規》(清, 1662-1722), https://www.amtb.tw/pdf/dzg_word.pdf",
      "review": {
        "text": "unreviewed",
        "ipa": "unreviewed",
        "by": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-02",
      "lang": "zh",
      "file": "zh-02.flac",
      "text": "方读此，勿慕彼，此未终，彼勿起。",
      "ipa": "fɑŋ˥ tu˧˥ t͡sʰɹ̩˨˩˦ u˥˩ mu˥˩ pi˨˩˦ t͡sʰɹ̩˨˩ weɪ˥˩ ʈ͡ʂʊŋ˥ pi˨˩ u˥˩ t͡ɕʰi˨˩˦",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "librivox-2245",
        "sex": "unknown"
      },
      "duration": 5.615,
      "sha256": "2dbf434f39f533292682fc85b522ccb815627edfd9e6de15f0f17390604670a7",
      "source": {
        "dataset": "librivox-di-zi-gui-zh-03",
        "page": "https://librivox.org/di-zi-gui-by-li-yuexiu/",
        "licence": "Public-Domain",
        "start": 542.03,
        "end": 547.645
      },
      "textSource": "李毓秀《弟子規》(清, 1662-1722), https://www.amtb.tw/pdf/dzg_word.pdf",
      "review": {
        "text": "unreviewed",
        "ipa": "unreviewed",
        "by": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-03",
      "lang": "zh",
      "file": "zh-03.flac",
      "text": "人不闲，勿事搅，人不安，勿话扰。",
      "ipa": "ʐən˧˥ pu˥˩ ɕjɛn˧˥ u˥˩ ʂɻ̩˥˩ t͡ɕjɑʊ˨˩˦ ʐən˧˥ pu˥˩ an˥ u˥˩ xwa˥˩ ʐɑʊ˨˩˦",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "librivox-2245",
        "sex": "unknown"
      },
      "duration": 5.765,
      "sha256": "7179f5132dbf57d081cb7fbbed05a6f3294fd85e3d7c6cdd6a20f70633b9682b",
      "source": {
        "dataset": "librivox-di-zi-gui-zh-03",
        "page": "https://librivox.org/di-zi-gui-by-li-yuexiu/",
        "licence": "Public-Domain",
        "start": 436.085,
        "end": 441.85
      },
      "textSource": "李毓秀《弟子規》(清, 1662-1722), https://www.amtb.tw/pdf/dzg_word.pdf",
      "review": {
        "text": "unreviewed",
        "ipa": "unreviewed",
        "by": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-04",
      "lang": "zh",
      "file": "zh-04.flac",
      "text": "心有疑，随札记，就人问，求确义。",
      "ipa": "ɕin˥ joʊ˨˩ i˧˥ sweɪ˧˥ ʈ͡ʂa˧˥ t͡ɕi˥˩ t͡ɕjoʊ˥˩ ʐən˧˥ wən˥˩ t͡ɕʰjoʊ˧˥ t͡ɕʰɥɛ˥˩ i˥˩",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "librivox-2245",
        "sex": "unknown"
      },
      "duration": 5.635,
      "sha256": "8ae7b186b8894e0a45e87f8e3001f1b161db4413e4730e564dae73be6b243f3c",
      "source": {
        "dataset": "librivox-di-zi-gui-zh-03",
        "page": "https://librivox.org/di-zi-gui-by-li-yuexiu/",
        "licence": "Public-Domain",
        "start": 553.195,
        "end": 558.83
      },
      "textSource": "李毓秀《弟子規》(清, 1662-1722), https://www.amtb.tw/pdf/dzg_word.pdf",
      "review": {
        "text": "unreviewed",
        "ipa": "unreviewed",
        "by": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-05",
      "lang": "zh",
      "file": "zh-05.flac",
      "text": "房室清，墙壁净，几案洁，笔砚正。",
      "ipa": "fɑŋ˧˥ ʂɻ̩˥˩ t͡ɕʰiŋ˥ t͡ɕʰjɑŋ˧˥ pi˥˩ t͡ɕiŋ˥˩ t͡ɕi˥ an˥˩ t͡ɕjɛ˧˥ pi˨˩ jɛn˥˩ ʈ͡ʂəŋ˥˩",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "librivox-2245",
        "sex": "unknown"
      },
      "duration": 5.77,
      "sha256": "f0590b3f6bd20dde1b59ebee7609a55c3f8f2a4f692f1eecd69118db5903921a",
      "source": {
        "dataset": "librivox-di-zi-gui-zh-03",
        "page": "https://librivox.org/di-zi-gui-by-li-yuexiu/",
        "licence": "Public-Domain",
        "start": 558.83,
        "end": 564.6
      },
      "textSource": "李毓秀《弟子規》(清, 1662-1722), https://www.amtb.tw/pdf/dzg_word.pdf",
      "review": {
        "text": "unreviewed",
        "ipa": "unreviewed",
        "by": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-06",
      "lang": "zh",
      "file": "zh-06.flac",
      "text": "勿谄富，勿骄贫，勿厌故，勿喜新。",
      "ipa": "u˥˩ ʈ͡ʂʰan˨˩ fu˥˩ u˥˩ t͡ɕjɑʊ˥ pʰin˧˥ u˥˩ jɛn˥˩ ku˥˩ u˥˩ ɕi˨˩ ɕin˥",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "librivox-2245",
        "sex": "unknown"
      },
      "duration": 5.665,
